# THE LOAD-BEARING ONE is src/CMakeLists.txt's /vmg plus the non-constexpr FunctionInfo in
# src/core/hle/service/service.h: without BOTH, MSVC miscompiles every HLE service handler table
# and games boot to a black screen with a 3DS fatal error. See citra-build-core.bat for the story.
